ty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years since 1951, on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025, September to October ran 72% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 73%. So far in 2026, January to February and February to March both sat at 46% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2005.</p>"}
